This Wikipedia Crawler was validated under Python 3.14
The program downloads all wikipedia webpages and saves them in the local file system as Html files
In addition a Mongo DB is created in a container with the following field for each document:
id - unique consecutive number
name - webpage name
file_path - location in the File System
timestamp ("%Y-%m-%d %H:%M:%S") - date and time downloaded

To run using docker:
> docker compose up --build -d